# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Keating et al. (2020a), MNRAS 491, 1736 (arXiv:1905.12640), Fig. 3 (top left, blue); called "Keating+19" in Cain+24:
#   Late-reionization model: ATON radiative transfer on a Sherwood-type P-Gadget-3 run (160 cMpc/h, 2048^3), with the
#   emissivity CHOSEN (an input, not a prediction) to match the pre-XQR-30 Lya forest: the mean transmission and tau_eff
#   distribution of Bosman et al. (2018) at z > 5 (Becker et al. 2015 below); h = 0.678.
#   Read from the published vector figure (axis calibrated on the tick marks; CoDa III: raster, pixel-traced),
